The directory vcs runs in for the x-heep e2e test (x-heep builds into
build/<core>/sim-vcs).  The test copies the whole xheep/ tree to a scratch
directory and runs, from here,

    vcs -sverilog ../../../hw/ip_examples/ams/rtl/tb_ams_adc.sv \
        -ad=../../../hw/ip_examples/ams/analog/control.init --vamos-analog=<engine> \
        --vamos-analog-maxstep=1n

as x-heep's patch_vcs_ams_Makefile.py appends -ad=... to its vcs line.
control.init's "choose xa ../../../hw/ip_examples/ams/analog/adc.sp" and
adc.sp's .include "../../../hw/ip_examples/ams/analog/65nm_bulk.pm" are relative
to this directory.
